        "Painful or spreading",
        "On face/genitals",
        "Immunocompromised",
        "Not improving with pharmacy care"
      ],
      "selfCare": [
        "Pharmacy wart treatments as labeled; cover verrucas in pools if advised; do not pick"
      ],
      "doNot": [
        "Do not cut warts out yourself",
        "Do not invent prescription regimens"
      ]
    },
